                <div class="pages_content" id="content"><p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 2em; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 2em; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 2em; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 2em; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em;"><img src="0de26d7a36e841c9a686e413e4aebdad/images/滴翠岩替换图1.jpg" style=" border:0px "></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent:21.0pt;line-height:2"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:微软雅黑,sans-serif;
mso-bidi-font-family:仿宋">滴翠岩位于恭王府花园中路、安善堂北边，是有一座由太湖石叠成的假山。藏有康熙御笔“福字碑”的秘云洞，就位于滴翠岩的腹部。假山顶是花园的制高点，顶上的建筑名为“绿天小隐”，建筑前面的平台为“邀月台”，是赏月的佳所。<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 2em; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 2em; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em;"><img src="0de26d7a36e841c9a686e413e4aebdad/images/滴翠岩替换图2.jpg" style=" border:0px "></p>
<span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt;">
<p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 2em; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"></p>
</font>
<p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 2em; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent:21.0pt;line-height:2"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:微软雅黑,sans-serif;
mso-bidi-font-family:仿宋">滴翠岩东西各有一条通向假山顶的曲径小道，小道顶端各卧有一带孔的水缸。过去，府中仆人把水蓄入缸内，夏、秋高温潮湿，石壁间便生出翠绿的苔藓，石黄苔绿、苍翠欲滴，故名“滴翠岩”。岩下长方形小池中有三组叠石，意为蓬莱、方丈、瀛洲三个仙岛。<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
</span></div>
