    "板厂胡同是南锣鼓巷东侧八条胡同之一。所给正文还记载，清代僧格林沁王府的后门在板厂胡同，但没有进一步说明板厂胡同本身的形成、长度、街巷格局或现存建筑。该历史关联不代表整条胡同均为王府遗存。": {
      "en": "Banchang Hutong is one of the eight hutongs on the east side of Nanluoguxiang. The text provided also records that the rear gate of Prince Senggelinqin’s residence in the Qing dynasty was on Banchang Hutong, but gives no further information on the formation, length, street pattern, or surviving buildings of Banchang Hutong itself. This historical association does not mean that the entire hutong consists of remains of the princely residence.",
